    "40_2008_L": "Bill No. 40-F of 2008\nTHE APPROPRIATION (No. 2)  BILL, 2008\n(AS PASSED BY THE HOUSES OF PARLIAMENT—\nLOK SABHA ON 24TH APRIL, 2008\nRAJYA SABHA ON 30TH APRIL, 2008 )\nASSENTED TO\nON 6 MAY, 2008\nACT NO. 17 OF 2008\n\n1\nTHE APPROPRIATION (No. 2) BILL, 2008\n(AS PASSED BY THE HOUSES OF PARLIAMENT)\nA\nBILL\nto authorise payment and appropriation of certain sums from and out of the\nConsolidated Fund of India for the services of the financial year 2008-09.\nBE it enacted by Parliament in the Fifty- ninth Year of the Republic of India as follows:—\n1. This Act may be called the Appropriation ( No. 2) Act, 2008.\n2.  From and out of the Consolidated Fund of India there may be paid and applied sums\nnot exceeding those specified in column 3 of the Schedule amounting in the  aggregate\n[inclusive of the sums specified in column 3 of the Schedule to the Appropriation  (Vote on\nAccount) Act, 2008] to the sum of twenty-five lakhs ninety-two thousand three hundred and\nninety-one crores and seventy-four lakh rupees towards  defraying the several charges\nwhich will come in course of payment during the financial year 2008-09 in respect of the\nservices  specified in column 2 of the Schedule.\nShort title.\nIssue of\nRs. 2592391,74,00,000\nout of the\nConsolidated\nFund of India\nfor the year\n2008-09.\n5 of 2008.\nBill No. 40-F of 2008\n\n2\n3.   The sums authorised to be paid and applied from and out of the Consolidated Fund\nof India by this Act shall be appropriated for the services and purposes expressed in the\nSchedule in relation to the said year.\n4.  References to Ministries or Departments in the Schedule are to such Ministries or\nDepartments as existing immediately before the 6th December, 2007 and shall, on or after that\ndate, be construed as references to the appropriate Ministries or Departments as\nreconstituted from time to time.\nAppropriation.\nConstruction\nof  references\nto Ministries\nand Depart-\nments in the\nSchedule.\n\n3\nTHE  